{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13204250","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13204250","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1320425001:0":{"text":"報告に戻ったんじゃなかったのかい？もしかして、またカタストロフの眷族が現れたのかい？","source_cn":"你们不是去向侍卫长汇报了吗，怎么回来了？难道附近还有冰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF249BB7B3822B6DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320425002:0":{"text":"いえいえ！その件は無事完結しました。護衛隊長にも報告済みです。","source_cn":"不，不不不！这件事已经彻底解决了，侍卫长那边也已经汇报完毕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FEAA811FDE93566","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320425003:1":{"text":"こちらにお邪魔したのは、協力してくださったお礼に、氷霜の松ぼっくりをお渡ししたくて……","source_cn":"我这次来，是想将这些珍霜松果送给各位，以此作为感谢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E4BA6E3C788ABE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320425004:0":{"text":"氷霜の松ぼっくり？なんだかすごく美味しそうな名前ですね！","source_cn":"珍霜松果……那是什么？听上去好好吃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3924D7CD2FAF5956","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320425005:0":{"text":"あははっ！これは食べ物じゃなくて、貴重な贈り物だよ、ハムっこ。","source_cn":"哈哈，小家伙，这可不是用来吃的，而是一种珍贵的礼物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB488D4E6F6A8E9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320425006:1":{"text":"ええ。この国では、英雄や自分を助けてくれた方に氷霜の松ぼっくりを贈る風習があるんですよ。","source_cn":"是的。在白山公国，我们会将珍霜松果送给英雄和对自己有恩的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x247F46148D07461F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320425007:0":{"text":"カタストロフの眷族を退治できたのは皆様のおかげですから、どうしても松ぼっくりをお渡ししたくて、先ほど摘みに行ったんです。","source_cn":"在清除恶魔眷属这件事上，几位的贡献不可忽视，所以我特意...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE0BA0D7D125FCEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1320425007":{"text":"カタストロフの眷族を退治できたのは皆様のおかげですから、どうしても松ぼっくりをお渡ししたくて、先ほど摘みに行ったんです。","source_cn":"在清除恶魔眷属这件事上，几位的贡献不可忽视，所以我特意采摘了这些松果，还望你们能够收下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE0BA0D7D125FCEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320425009:0":{"text":"ん？この匂いは……","source_cn":"……嗯？这气味是……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF5A4407734DFE198","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ん？この匂いは……","female":"ん？この匂いは……","variant_male_record_index":"145595","variant_female_record_index":"145596","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320425010:0":{"text":"どうされました、ガルダさん。松ぼっくりに何か問題でも？","source_cn":"怎么了？格尔达女士，这些松果哪里不对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADDA05D73863BC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320425011:0":{"text":"ううん、ただ……どうもかすかに硫黄の匂いがするような……","source_cn":"没什么，我只是在松果上闻到了很淡的硫磺气味。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x314BC9BEFD3EE732","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320425012:0":{"text":"本当ですか！？それって、松ぼっくりを摘んだ場所の近くに温泉があるってことじゃ……？","source_cn":"真的吗？！那是不是说明，在采摘松果的地方周围就有温泉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFB65D7D3A5F2874","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320425013:0":{"text":"そうとも限らないよ。硫黄を含む物はなにも温泉だけじゃないからねえ。でも、行ってみる価値はあるだろうね！","source_cn":"也不一定。有很多东西都包含硫磺，未必和温泉有关。不过嘛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF3901E56863D086","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320425014:1":{"text":"隊長さん、どこでこれを摘んだか覚えてるかい？","source_cn":"领队，你还记得采摘松果的地方在哪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x623660442B160F65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320425015:0":{"text":"もちろんです。<style=\"highlight\">旅館の北にある凍った川</style>の所ですよ。滝に近い川辺です。","source_cn":"当然记得。就在<style=highlight>旅店北...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x409839CA38045729","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320425016:0":{"text":"なら早速見に行ってみましょう！もしかしたら本当に野湯があるかも！","source_cn":"那我们就赶快过去吧！说不定真的能找到野温泉呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF642B2ABAE0DF4A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"光栄だよ。","source_cn":"这是我的荣幸","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x99139323E3B03FE2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"光栄だよ。","female":"光栄だわ。","variant_male_record_index":"68696","variant_female_record_index":"68697","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"text":"そこまで言うなら受け取るよ。","source_cn":"那我就勉为其难地收下吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0899A11FFBDFFFAE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"そこまで言うなら受け取るよ。","female":"そこまで言うなら受け取るわ。","variant_male_record_index":"68698","variant_female_record_index":"68699","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320425008:0":{"text":"え？あ……はい！承知いたしました！","source_cn":"啊……？哦！好的，我记住了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA19A983CC7FA8244","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"え？あ……はい！承知いたしました！","female":"え？あ……はい！承知いたしました！","variant_male_record_index":"145593","variant_female_record_index":"145594","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:2:3":{"text":"次からお礼はお金で頼むよ。","source_cn":"下次记得用钱犒劳我","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB21C3C3D4C6EAE81","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_diffe